928"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="360" w:lineRule="auto"/><w:jc w:val="both"/></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0891B507" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00095928" w:rsidRDefault="00095928"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="360" w:lineRule="auto"/><w:jc w:val="both"/></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0891B516" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00095928" w:rsidRDefault="00000000" w:rsidP="00530DE0"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t>7. Conclusion</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0891B517" w14:textId="7649DF87" w:rsidR="00095928" w:rsidRDefault="00530DE0"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="360" w:lineRule="auto"/><w:jc w:val="both"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:tab/><w:t>The Nory Music Learning Platform is a holistic online learning suite that combines music theory lessons, beginner guitar lessons, and more into a single platform. The platform includes user management, learner progress tracking tools, quizzes, structured lessons, and other features to provide a fun and effective learning experience.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0891B518" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00095928" w:rsidRDefault="00000000"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="360" w:lineRule="auto"/><w:jc w:val="both"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Developed using ASP.It showcases real-life application of current web development technologies, database management, and authentication and authorization, while also using CRUD operations, all in NET Core MVC, CMicrosoft SQL Server, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript. The platform could additionally be enhanced with more pedagogical instruments, mobile apps, and live tutoring, in addition to AI-enabled learning capabilities, that will enhance the learning experience and overall enhancements.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0891B519" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00095928" w:rsidRDefault="00095928"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="360" w:lineRule="auto"/><w:jc w:val="both"/></w:pPr></w:p><w:sectPr w:rsidR="00095928"><w:pgSz w:w="11906" w:h="16838"/><w:pgMar w:top="1440" w:right="1440" w:bottom="1440" w:left="1440" w:header="708" w:footer="708" w:gutter="0"/><w:pgNumType w:start="1"/><w:cols w:space="720"/></w:sectPr></w:body></w:document>